# Notation the check must keep, not refuse: aromatic rings, charges, ring
# closures above 9, isotopes, a disconnected salt and a stereocentre. One
# entry per line; each becomes its own configuration.
#
# No bare-ion entry here on purpose: this contract writes ions as CCD codes
# (rule R-BND-001), so `[Zn+2]` alone is refused for that reason, not by the
# notation check. A bracketed isotope is a molecule and stays.
aspirin CC(=O)Oc1ccccc1C(=O)O
saline [Na+].[Cl-]
macrocycle C%10CCCCCC%10
alanine C[C@H](N)C(=O)O
deuterated-methane [2H]C([2H])([2H])[2H]
isotopic-methane [13CH4]
